<title>UK: Time Warner not to list on London bourse.</title>
<headline>Time Warner not to list on London bourse.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Time Warner Inc said on Thursday that it would not proceed with listing of its common stock on the London Stock Exchange following its acquisition of Turner Broadcasting System Inc last October.</p>
<p>Time Warner's stock would continue to trade on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Time Warner did not give details of its decision to not list on LSE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
